WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.418
(upbeat music)

00:00:01.418 --> 00:00:04.755
[Nellie] My bridesmaid entrances
are the stuff of legends.

00:00:04.755 --> 00:00:05.839
Ever, the bridesmaid.

00:00:05.839 --> 00:00:07.090
That is my badge of honor.

00:00:08.008 --> 00:00:08.759
You feel me?

00:00:08.759 --> 00:00:09.843
[Conor] I feel you.

00:00:09.843 --> 00:00:11.428
♪ We were young ♪

00:00:11.428 --> 00:00:12.387
[Nellie] I go to weddings

00:00:12.387 --> 00:00:14.264
and baby showers
every damn weekend.

00:00:14.264 --> 00:00:15.766
[Richard] When are you gonna
gimme grandkids?

00:00:15.766 --> 00:00:17.601
- Talk to your firstborn
about grandchildren.

00:00:17.601 --> 00:00:18.644
- I don't want him procreating.

00:00:18.644 --> 00:00:19.436
[Jesse] No.

00:00:19.436 --> 00:00:20.395
- That's a terrifying thought.

00:00:20.395 --> 00:00:21.813
- Yeah, nobody wants that.
- Nobody wants that.

00:00:21.813 --> 00:00:24.191
- I don't have a man
or any legit prospects.

00:00:24.191 --> 00:00:25.359
What have I ever done?

00:00:25.359 --> 00:00:26.860
Am I not suitable for life?

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:29.029
[Sheila] You are very
suitable for life.

00:00:29.029 --> 00:00:30.864
- I feel like I'm running
out of time.

00:00:30.864 --> 00:00:34.117
[Monroe] Are you seeing
anyone now?

00:00:34.117 --> 00:00:35.619
- I'm seeing everyone now.

00:00:35.619 --> 00:00:37.287
It's sort of an all
you can eat buffet.

00:00:37.287 --> 00:00:38.038
- How old are you?

00:00:38.038 --> 00:00:40.249
Please say 32 or 33.

00:00:40.249 --> 00:00:41.500
Nellie?

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:42.834
- I'm 34.

00:00:42.834 --> 00:00:43.794
(slap smacks)

00:00:43.794 --> 00:00:44.836
- Stupid.

00:00:44.836 --> 00:00:47.339
♪ Let's make a run for it ♪

00:00:47.339 --> 00:00:50.801
- I want you to remember they
can be in Never-Neverland,

00:00:50.801 --> 00:00:52.803
never growing up, never aging.

00:00:52.803 --> 00:00:54.888
But those eggs, they are.

00:00:54.888 --> 00:00:56.431
(cheerful music)

00:00:56.431 --> 00:00:58.976
- If I don't spend
13K to freeze my eggs,

00:00:58.976 --> 00:01:00.352
I might never be
able to have kids.

00:01:00.352 --> 00:01:02.646
Meanwhile, you're gonna
wait 'til you're 70

00:01:02.646 --> 00:01:05.399
to have a baby
with an influencer.

00:01:05.399 --> 00:01:06.900
- That is accurate

00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:08.819
and I'm not
embarrassed about it.

00:01:09.653 --> 00:01:11.113
[Sara] What's new
with you, Nellie?

00:01:11.113 --> 00:01:13.156
- I'm thinking about
getting my eggs frozen.

00:01:13.156 --> 00:01:14.324
- That's amazing!

00:01:14.324 --> 00:01:16.243
- Maybe I should
have a baby shower.

00:01:16.243 --> 00:01:18.745
[Jen] But you're not
having a baby.

00:01:18.745 --> 00:01:20.747
(cheerful music)

00:01:20.747 --> 00:01:21.915
- What if I screw this up?

00:01:21.915 --> 00:01:23.959
I don't even know
if I want kids.

00:01:23.959 --> 00:01:24.835
I've seen "Euphoria."

00:01:24.835 --> 00:01:26.503
[Nurse Ali] You're not
gonna screw this up.

00:01:26.503 --> 00:01:27.754
(Nellie cheers)

00:01:27.754 --> 00:01:29.006
♪ I love me ♪

00:01:29.006 --> 00:01:30.632
♪ Gonna love myself,
no, I don't need ♪

00:01:30.632 --> 00:01:31.842
- You're buying time.

00:01:31.842 --> 00:01:33.969
Someone who's good enough
for you is hard to come by.

00:01:33.969 --> 00:01:35.762
♪ No, I don't need
anybody else ♪

00:01:35.762 --> 00:01:38.181
- I'm either going
through a Renaissance or

00:01:38.181 --> 00:01:41.143
amidst the worst
crisis of my lifetime.

00:01:42.936 --> 00:01:44.938
♪ I love me ♪

00:01:44.938 --> 00:01:46.064
[Doctor] Here we go.

00:01:46.064 --> 00:01:47.107
Down here,

00:01:47.107 --> 00:01:49.735
and you look like, I'd say...
- Virgin?

00:01:49.735 --> 00:01:51.695
- (chuckles) Definitely not.

00:01:51.695 --> 00:01:52.487
Okay.

00:01:52.487 --> 00:01:54.489
♪ I love me ♪

